", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974685_1840524873122821_3055739933188055904_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=v1YTY-VNK7wQ7kNvwHoXLHY&_nc_oc=AdqsuTWQBwLEM_b78ZQpJt0uQTIevf8A7pVcpJXrN2oiF_1FkLxmzQ0S1xbeqPfGbAg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af1kpCi8eFYd8FCQ2Td3tPXbbAS-C1XROrs6O43_1J5TpA&oe=69ECC3F9"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "3474397939524850", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974494_3474397942858183_7325370313459975246_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mWS3de7Zj-MQ7kNvwFLOvBR&_nc_oc=AdpeBIbGMPMtrE1eRGlMfWlxNY2M-4ExKPH_nefOvcQ-tSkNVWKYyJrEtl5S-Z68bE0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af2cRb-gOghw5pEBIKau-1eGgZP0aOjSi6D2DNwdVYieQw&oe=69ECA28B"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Hard Drive Logo (6).png", "id": "1060475455596738", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984476_1060475458930071_8663595066419356644_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GPdVZfSm8wIQ7kNvwGxn-gk&_nc_oc=AdrC9Eu_la0-cXmnhRrheXSQ7jmUdYw_6WFYU13PdP2-oHB8cNhL5eVIZkJnP6ckIb0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af2_MnUyuooYonGh2oFsTyM26jOIujieRnyw9wOR8inbVQ&oe=69ECA10E"}, "display_name": "Hard Drive", "keywords": [], "long_description": "# *Hard Drive* \n\nHard Drive is a fast-paced, multiplayer, competitive electro combat driving game. Players control sleek, neon-lit motorcycle looking vehicles, known as bykes, which leave behind a temporary solid trail of light as they move. Players must outmaneuver their opponents by creating a trails of light that they cannot avoid crashing into, while avoiding the trails left by other players.\n\n# _Current Features_\n- Non PvP Driving Park\n- 6 Player Combat Arena\n- Season Pass with Progression Rewards\n- Cosmetic Shop \n\n## More Coming Soon. . .", "short_description": "Electro Combat Driving "}]}, "devel